Case spec:
{
  "set": "extraction",
  "persona": {
    "country": "NG",
    "trade": "small-business website build",
    "offering": "services",
    "currency": "USD"
  },
  "hinglish": false,
  "injection_in_buyer_chat": false,
  "documents": [
    {
      "kind": "scope",
      "write": "the buyer's brief or order form"
    },
    {
      "kind": "communication",
      "write": "buyer-seller chat"
    },
    {
      "kind": "invoice",
      "write": "the seller's invoice or payment receipt"
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "amount"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "deliverable"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "date"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "party"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "unverifiable",
      "field": "party"
    }
  ]
}
Each hypothesis is one fact of the given field, written as 'Field: value' in text, with the bare value in value. For a missing or unverifiable target, text names the fact a reader would look for (for example 'Date: dispatch date of the parcel') and value is null.

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Website project brief",
      "text": "Buyer: Nela Sori, owner of Kima Fern Studio\nSeller: Tavi Noro, freelance web designer in Nigeria\n\nProject: Build a five-page website for the studio. The pages should be Home, About, Services, Gallery and Contact. Use the text and photographs I will supply, and make the layout work on phones as well as desktops.\n\nThe contact page should include a working enquiry form. Please deliver the finished site files and a short handover guide. I will arrange my own hosting after handover.\n\nAgreed delivery date: 18 June 2026.\nPlease send the files to my email once I have reviewed the final version."
    },
    {
      "title": "Buyer-seller chat",
      "text": "2 June, 09:10 — Nela: Thanks for taking on the studio website. I have sent the photographs and page text.\n2 June, 09:18 — Tavi: Received. I’ll build the five pages and include the enquiry form we discussed.\n2 June, 09:21 — Nela: Please keep the colours quiet and make the gallery easy to browse on a phone.\n2 June, 09:27 — Tavi: Will do. The agreed delivery date is 18 June 2026, with the site files and handover guide sent by email.\n2 June, 09:30 — Nela: That works. Please invoice me in USD through PayPal.\n2 June, 09:34 — Tavi: I’ll send the invoice today."
    },
    {
      "title": "Seller invoice",
      "text": "Invoice\nIssued: 2 June 2026\nFrom: Tavi Noro, Nigeria\nTo: Nela Sori, Kima Fern Studio\n\nFive-page website design and build: USD 420.00\nContact enquiry form: included\nSite files and handover guide: included\n\nTotal due: USD 420.00\nPayment method: PayPal\n\nThe project covers the Home, About, Services, Gallery and Contact pages described in the buyer’s brief. The buyer will provide the text and photographs and arrange hosting separately. The agreed delivery date for the files and guide is 18 June 2026. Please review the invoice details before making payment."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Amount: USD 420.00",
      "value": "USD 420.00"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deliverable: five-page website",
      "value": "five-page website"
    },
    {
      "text": "Date: 18 June 2026",
      "value": "18 June 2026"
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: Nela Sori",
      "value": "Nela Sori"
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: name of the person who paid the invoice",
      "value": null
    }
  ]
}
